'''Logchopper''' is an [[Ancient Weapons|ancient]] knife originally obtainable by purchasing the 30th tier in the Main Event for 70,000 [[Snow Tokens]] during the [[Christmas Event 2019|2019 Christmas Event]]. It is now only obtainable through trading as the event has since ended.   

== Appearance ==
It resembles an axe used to chop logs, hence the name. Its blade is made up of gingerbread with golden frosting on it, which is held together by the thin candy cane handle. It has a silver edge with sharp indents on it. Above the handle is a golden orb, and attached to it is another smaller gingerbread blade with a sharp and big silver edge on one side and a smaller silver edge on the other side. The handle’s pommel is golden with a holly attached to the bottom of it.  

== Trivia ==
*This is the first ancient weapon that is not a scythe and the first to resemble an axe, second being [[Icebreaker]], third being [[Swirly Axe]], fourth being [[Traveler's Axe]], and the fifth and final one being [[Vampire's Axe]].
*It was designed and textured by [[IDontHaveAUse]].
*There are [[Blue Logchopper|blue]], [[Bronze Logchopper|bronze]], [[Silver Logchopper|silver]], and [[Gold Logchopper|gold]] reskin variants of this knife, which were released as [[Unique Weapons|unique]] trophies during the event. 
*It partners with the [[Godly Weapons|godly]] gun [[Minty]], making the [[Murder Mystery 2 Wiki:Wiki-Bot/Logchopper Set|Logchopper Set]].
*Its mesh, published by [[didi1147]], can be found [https://www.roblox.com/library/4535638625/Meshes-LogChopper2 here]. 
*There was a bug where if players equipped the [[Knifeception]] effect with this knife, small images of [[BattleAxe II|BattleAxe II’s]] derived model would appear. However, this has since been patched.
*This is the second christmas ancient weapon to be added in game, the first being [[Icewing]].

